    <string name="privacy_body">Abayisilamu bubaha ubuzima bwawe kandi ntibakusanya amakuru yawe. Uruhushya gusa mugihe bikenewe: turasaba uruhushya (ahantu, kumenyesha) gusa mugihe ikintu kibakeneye rwose, hamwe nibisobanuro bisobanutse.\n • Nta guhuza ku gahato: porogaramu ikora kumurongo; gukoresha imiyoboro irahitamo rwose kubinyongera nko gukuramo ibyasomwe.\n\nIyi politiki ni igice cyububiko bwuzuye kandi burakinguye kubaturage.</string>
